    <h1 class="case-h1 reveal reveal-delay-1">Rebranding a mid-sized company: why the company name was the real obstacle</h1>
    <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-2" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);max-width:720px;margin-top:1rem;">Nobody had doubted the name — until Lünstroth did.</p>
  </div>
